  <text>
      <body>
         <div type="performance_playbill" rend="align(center)">
            <ab><placeName ref="namedentities.xml#haymarket">Theatre-Royal, Hay-Market</placeName>.<lb/>
               This <hi rend="allcaps">evening</hi>, <date when="1811-05-29">Wednesday, May 29, 1811</date><lb/>
               Will be perform'd (By Permission of the Proprietors of the Theatre-Royal, Covent-Garden)<lb/>
               the Musical Piece of<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_paul_and_virginia">Paul and Virginia.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Paul,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_paine">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Paine</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Alambra,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_wheatley">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Wheatley</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Tropic,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_shaw">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Shaw</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Don Anthonio,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_finn">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Finn</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Dominique,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_mallinson">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Mallinson</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Diego,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_lewes">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Lewes</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Sebastian,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ge_sm">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Smith</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Officer,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_hodson">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Hodson</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Sailor,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_haughton">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Haughton</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Virginia,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_bellchambers">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Bellchambers</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Jacintha,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_watson">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Watson</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Mary,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_stokes">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Stokes</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Chorus of Inhabitants,</role> Messrs. <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_linton">Linton,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_eames">Eames,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_terry">Terry,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_griffith">Griffith,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_oddwell">Oddwell,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_willoughby">Willoughby,</actor><lb/>
                     <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_diether">Diether,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_ca">Caulfield,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_harrison">Harrison,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_warner">Warner,</actor> &amp;c.<lb/>
                     Messdms. <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_decamp">De Camp,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_stokes">Stokes,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_kendall">Kendall,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_haughton">Haughton,</actor> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_danton">Danton.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               The Dances by Messrs. <persName ref="namedentities.xml#j_we">Wells</persName>, <persName ref="namedentities.xml#mr_hope">Hope</persName>, <persName ref="namedentities.xml#mr_taylor">Taylor</persName>, <persName ref="namedentities.xml#mr_widdicombe">Widdicombe</persName>, <persName ref="namedentities.xml#mr_cross">Cross</persName>, <persName ref="namedentities.xml#mr_brown">Brown</persName>, &amp;c.<lb/>
               Messdms. <persName ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_stokes">Stokes</persName>, <persName ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_barrett">Barrett</persName>, <persName ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_taylor">Taylor</persName>, <persName ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_danton">Danton</persName>, <persName ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_haughton">Haughton</persName>, <persName ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_byrne">Byrne</persName>.<lb/>
               After which (<hi rend="allcaps">Fourth Time</hi>) A Comick Piece in Two Acts, call'd The<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_trial_by_jury">Trial by Jury.</title></bibl><lb/>
               With <hi rend="allcaps">New Scenery, Dresses</hi>, &amp;c.<lb/>
               <castList>
                  <head>The Characters by</head><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#ro_wi_el">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Elliston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_barnes">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Barnes</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_r_jones">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">R. Jones</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#jo_li">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Liston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_bellchambers">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Bellchambers</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem>And <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ma_gi">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Gibbs</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               To which will be added, the Comedy of<lb/>
               <bibl><title ref="namedentities.xml#play_three_weeks_after_marriage">Three Weeks After Marriage.</title></bibl><lb/>
               <castList>
                  <castItem><role>Sir Charles Racket,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ro_wi_el">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Elliston</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Drugget,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_barnes">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Barnes</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Woodley,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ge_sm">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Smith</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Servant,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mr_widdicombe">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Widdicombe</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Lady Racket,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#ju_gl">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Glover</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Miss Drugget,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#mrs_grove">Mrs. <hi rend="allcaps">Grove</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
                  <castItem><role>Nancy,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_decamp">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">De Camp</hi>.</actor></castItem> <castItem><role>Dimity,</role> <actor ref="namedentities.xml#miss_watson">Miss <hi rend="allcaps">Watson</hi>.</actor></castItem><lb/>
               </castList>
               <hi rend="allcaps">Boxes</hi> <measure type="currency">5s</measure>. <hi rend="allcaps">Pit</hi> <measure type="currency">3s</measure>. <hi rend="allcaps">First Gallery</hi> <measure type="currency">2s</measure>. <hi rend="allcaps">Second Gallery</hi> <measure type="currency">1s</measure>.<lb/>
               The Doors to be Opened at <time when="18:00:00">Six o'Clock</time>, and the Performance to begin at <time when="19:00:00">Seven</time>.<lb/>
               Places for the Boxes to be taken of <persName ref="namedentities.xml#mr_mas">Mr. <hi rend="allcaps">Massingham</hi></persName> at the Theatre.<lb/>
               The Publick is respectfully inform'd that The New Comick Piece of The <hi rend="allcaps">Trial</hi><lb/>
               <hi rend="allcaps">By Jury</hi> having been receieved, on its Third Representation, with unbounded and rei-<lb/>
               terated applause, will be repeated every evening, till further notice.</ab>
         </div>
      </body>
  </text>
